{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41899","headline":"送孙霁书记赴寿阳[辟]命 · 李中","name":"送孙霁书记赴寿阳[辟]命","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辟命羡君赴，其如怆别情。\n酒阑汀树晚，帆展野风生。\n淮静寒烟歛，村遥夜火明。\n醉沈朐岭梦，吟达寿春城。\n旧友摇鞭接，元戎扫榻迎。\n雪晴莲幕啓，云散桂山横。\n王粲从军画，陈琳草檄名。\n知君提健笔，重振此嘉声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41899.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41899","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}